{"generated": "2026-10-23 07:47", "brief": "<b>1. SK하이닉스의 솔리다임 상장(IPO) 전격 중단</b>\nSK하이닉스가 자회사 솔리다임의 프리IPO 및 미국 증시 상장 검토를 전면 중단했습니다. 시장 여건 변화와 중복상장 논란, 주주가치 제고 등을 고려한 결정으로 풀이됩니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE1rdlJNUXk5MzRuTUtJRlZYWklicmpKb1llTDk1bTNVNnNBb3ZPTFRoN1BGVW9Wcmk0QjlOd2kxY2ZHVGMxQjVweEpYdUVRaW1waXdNV096R05QRVduUkIxZ3pR?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#16</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE1XNUxBd2l5dnZhWmV4eHJQOEtWNl93SU5jdXBkeU5NNDJuRXZOYTZLVnFtYXlfV1UxbjZGOXc2QVNkbFRwUGdtWGFlTWh0REU4SmV0WGJ1WWs5bGtO?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#21</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTE1MemtuMy1PM1Iwbk9YRXVhVnl3WThYYzdsNkltWXhvbGRPcHNudWJNSUxBa0FPNldOUGh6MjZRelNNelB0VFBObDVTYW1kcno0b19FbnpzcWMxRGZnQm1Z?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#30</a>].\n\n<b>2. 빅테크 AI 기업들의 대규모 자금 조달 및 상장 전망</b>\n오픈AI가 IPO를 앞두고 기업가치를 1조 2,500억 달러로 하향 조정하며 300억 달러 규모의 신규 자금 조달을 추진하고 있습니다. 한편 글로벌 시장에서는 앤스로픽의 상장 추진에 따라 주요 투자사들의 수혜 기대감과 리스크가 동시에 조명받고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE5FS29Gb2RvUDdjMmh5SDNZTXQwR0xuNUprUlA0Yld4VnFhbGVCQ1hkaTZRbWpKWE1JbmQ0UVRHVDItbEJnVW83ejhaNEQ3OFJVVWs5Ym5JclBfMEJCQmRKVHNyaV9jM3RsM0dnSnRhV1NzVTA?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#20</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE5ESnc3RmpFdGxHQlpqMlM0RlVvblh3UGY3Uk0tN3QydzFDT3dCcU1DUGs1VGJDNU1iMTltOUUyTnZadno4OTFVM3NnZTNUdThN?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#35</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOaThJaXdzWGlXNGc2U3hpQWV3WGRUV3JUTlhWdG5tb2dHWGE1ZFJlQ3NJU2dLUDFFV2djRFNJcHJwc0o4ZUZqbTdBcDhDT0NsM2dQb3RfZE4yNGRQMW9uemxEMkdFQWtFa2ZpTVJqd3U3LUJ3VUJPUHNzNm1yV0FTNWVoZ2IyX0szNFg4WlViX3d0UWU0cXA2alpzajI2YXlLRHNCNWdXa3E?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#37</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxNcjJvQjRXQ1VibUgyanZmMGJsNzRFN19Id2NRaU5TSFlSSXBNOWt2WlVYUWFFUlFvWi1nN2Jnd3UxNkc2OXpJc